All 177 test cases pass. Every case-study folder contains the program, a test file, the sample
output and a `README.md` with the problem statement, objectives, assumptions, algorithm, pseudocode,
flowchart, test-case table and conclusion.

The **consolidated PDF report** (all 10 case studies with code, flowcharts, test tables and outputs) is in
[`report/Python-ABL-Consolidated-Report.pdf`](report/Python-ABL-Consolidated-Report.pdf).

