## How to Run

Requires Python 3.8 or later. No external libraries are needed.

```bash
cd 01_banking_system
python banking_system.py          # interactive program
python banking_system.py --demo   # automatic sample run (used for the output section)
python test_banking_system.py     # run all test cases of this program
```

The same pattern works for every folder (use the file names shown in the table above).
(The Sudoku program has no menu; running it simply solves the sample puzzle.)


